 site variable with_pr temp_only shift
 MORA      MAT    0.73      0.73     0
 MORA     MSpT    0.69      0.69     0
 MORA      MST    0.73      0.73     0
 MORA      MWT    0.57      0.57     0
 NOCA      MAT    0.61      0.61     0
